// เทียบผลของ Agent กับคำตอบที่คาดหวัง แล้วสรุปเป็นคะแนน
const tests = $('อ่านชุดทดสอบ').all().map(i => i.json);
const results = $input.all().map((item, i) => {
  const t = tests[i];
  const out = item.json.output || {};
  return {
    id: t.id,
    category_ok: out.category === t.expected_category,
    urgency_ok: out.urgency === t.expected_urgency,
    callback_ok: out.callback === t.expected_callback,
    got: `${out.category} / ${out.urgency} / ${out.callback}`,
    expected: `${t.expected_category} / ${t.expected_urgency} / ${t.expected_callback}`,
  };
});
const count = (k) => results.filter(r => r[k]).length;
const wrong = results.filter(r => !(r.category_ok && r.urgency_ok && r.callback_ok));
return [{ json: {
  total: results.length,
  category: count('category_ok'),
  urgency: count('urgency_ok'),
  callback: count('callback_ok'),
  wrong,
} }];
